//
// Cross-CTA coupling each column step is a tiny per-matrix reduction:
//   * tail2 (1 scalar) and w[c]=v_k . panel[:,c] for all c (BLK scalars).
// Each CTA atomic-adds its slice partial into a per-matrix global scratch row,
